</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><p>Notification of Joint Finance Committee meetings to discuss Grant-in-Aid are posted on the internet and provided to the media. Meetings are open to the public. Please check the&nbsp;<a href="/Committee/JointFinance">Joint Finance Committee Public Hearing page</a>&nbsp;to view the schedule.</p>

